<title>USA: Weekly NOPA soybean crush trade estimates.</title>
<headline>Weekly NOPA soybean crush trade estimates.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the National Oilseed Processors Association (NOPA) weekly U.S. soybean crush figure due this afternoon were as follows (in million bushels).</p>
<p>   Estimate range    Week ago actual  Two weeks ago</p>
<p>    22.70-23.50	     22.92	     24.27</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
